<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 567.16, down 3.78.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 305 to 237.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.09.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,836,780, compared with 20,077,460 Monday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
